            <ArticleTitle>A rare cause of acute abdomen after proctocolectomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e41-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.amjsurg.2008.04.021</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Although proctocolectomy and ileal pouch surgery is a routine part of modern-day management for complicated ulcerative colitis, these patients are often debilitated and require close and attentive management in the early postoperative period. Here we present a rare but clinically important postoperative complication.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
